---
source: crates/loom/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "loom_help(&[\"tune\", \"skill\"])"
---
List or tune skills.

Usage: loom tune skill [OPTIONS] [fast|run|full] [NAME]...

Arguments:
  [fast|run|full]  Proposal level [possible values: fast, run, full]
  [NAME]...        Target names to tune after the level

Options:
      --dry-run           Print the frozen tune plan without creating a proposal
  -w, --workspace <PATH>  Workspace root. Defaults to the current working directory
      --host-key          Explicitly allow ambient host Git credentials and signing config
      --seed <N>          Deterministic checker-plan seed
  -A, --agent <BACKEND>   Override the agent backend for this invocation [possible values: claude, pi, direct]
  -h, --help              Print help
